OL,3,ABurnham pledges 'new era of British
OL,4,Aleadership' on climate in speech at
OL,5,ACOP31 summit
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK Prime Minister Andy Burnham has been
OL,8,Fspeaking at the COP31 climate
OL,9,Fconference in Antalya, Turkey, on the
OL,10,Ffourth day of the annual UN summit
OL,12,FHe pledged a "new era of British
OL,13,Fleadership" on climate, while
OL,14,Freiterating the UK's ambition to reach
OL,15,Fnet zero by 2050
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
