OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham pledges 'new era of British
OL,4,Aleadership' on climate in speech at
OL,5,ACOP31 summit
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham, the only G7 leader to attend
OL,8,Fthis year's summit, also announced the
OL,9,Fappointment of a new climate security
OL,10,Fenvoy, Dame Madeleine Alessandri, with
OL,11,Fthe government saying she will help
OL,12,Fidentify, plan and prepare for climate
OL,13,Frisks before they reach crisis point
OL,15,FIt comes after the PM was pressed by
OL,16,FTory leader Kemi Badenoch in Parliament
OL,17,Fon Wednesday about whether the Rosebank
OL,18,Foil field would be allowed to proceed
OL,20,FIn October the government
OL,21,Fcontroversially approved drilling in
OL,22,Fthe Jackdaw gas field in the North Sea
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
