OL,3,ABurnham pledges 'new era of British
OL,4,Aleadership' on climate in speech at
OL,5,ACOP31 summit
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe world is currently on track for
OL,8,F2.8C of warming above pre-industrial
OL,9,Flevels by the end of the century - and
OL,10,Fis all but guaranteed to exceed the
OL,11,F2015 Paris Agreement goal of trying to
OL,12,Flimit the increase to 1.5C
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
